---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Bizzon — Everyday browser tools" description="What Bizzon does, how its tools work, and how to report a problem." canonicalPath="/about">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="orbit-kicker">Bizzon / field notes</p>
    <h1 class="orbit-display mt-4 text-5xl text-slate-950">About Bizzon</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Bizzon is a collection of small utilities for everyday text, numbers, files, and sharing tasks. Open a tool, enter what you need to work on, and copy or download the result without creating an account.</p>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">What the project is for</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Count a draft, clean pasted text, prepare filenames, create a QR image, or check a calculation. The <a class="underline" href="/tools">tool library</a> groups these tasks by use. Practical guides explain examples and tradeoffs; tools show their inputs and results so you can review the work.</p></section>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">How to use the results</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Tools apply specific formatting rules or formulas. They cannot check every destination platform, language, tax rule, or file system. Review transformed text before replacing an original, scan a QR code before printing, and verify financial calculations before using them in a real transaction. Bizzon is a utility project, not a tax or legal advisory service.</p></section>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">Privacy and feedback</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Most tool inputs are processed locally in your browser. The site also loads external services, and some tools make network requests. Read the <a class="underline" href="/privacy">Privacy page</a> for those details. If something looks wrong, <a class="underline" href="/contact">contact Bizzon</a> with the tool name, expected result, and a small non-sensitive example that reproduces the problem.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
